        "product_summary": "Knit slip-on casual shoes with an EVA sole and a low-cut opening. The textured upper and lace-look front retain a familiar sneaker appearance in a slip-on style. Black, Grey and Brown provide neutral assortment directions.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear factory supplier based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We serve importers, wholesalers, online sellers and private-label buyers with casual walking shoes and related footwear. Sample review, mixed size and color requirements, and OEM/ODM options can be discussed according to product availability, quantity, materials, logo and packing requirements. Product details and delivery arrangements are confirmed before order placement."
